                                "sense_id": "c5b37a86-e35f-361b-8a09-a49383a60a5a",
                                "text": "Trying to write honestly about pornographic films is like trying to tie one's shoe while walking: it's practically impossible without sacrificing stride and balance and a certain amount of ordinary dignity, the sort one uses with bank tellers who question a signature."
                            },
